    "summary": "The purpose of this study is to test a new medicine, vepugratinib, in comparison with placebo, to see if it is safe and can help people with a bladder cancer that is advanced or has spread.\n\nVepugratinib or placebo will be administered in combination with enfortumab vedotin and pembrolizumab.\n\nStudy participation could last up to approximately 6 years.",
